  "chapter": 62,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, to Jeduthun, A Psalm of David. Truly my soul waiteth upon God: from him ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "cometh",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He only ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my rock and my salvation; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my defense; I shall not be greatly moved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How long will ye imagine mischief against a man? ye shall be slain all of you: as a bowing wall ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall ye be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a tottering fence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They only consult to cast ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " down from his excellence: they delight in lies: they bless with their mouth, but they curse inwardly. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My soul, wait thou only upon God; for my expectation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He only ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my rock and my salvation: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my defense; I shall not be moved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my salvation and my glory: the rock of my strength, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my refuge, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Trust in him at all times; ye people, pour out your heart before him: God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a refuge for us. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely men of low degree ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " vanity, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " men of high degree ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a lie: to be laid in the balance, they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " altogether ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "lighter",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " than vanity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Trust not in oppression, and become not vain in robbery: if riches increase, set not your heart ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "upon them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God hath spoken once; twice have I heard this; that power ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belongeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.62.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also to thee, O LORD, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belongeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mercy: for thou renderest to every man according to his work.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
